<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Oct net foreign debt narrows to $12.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Oct net foreign debt narrows to $12.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's net foreign debt narrowed to $12.7 billion at the end of October from $13.2 billion in September, the National Bank of Hungary said on Friday.</p>
</text>
